A '''howler''' was ridden by [[Shin Hati]] during the [[quest to find Ezra Bridger]] on the [[Far galaxy|extragalactic]] planet of [[Peridea]]. After [[Mitth'raw'nuruodo|Thrawn]] instructed Hati and her master [[Baylan Skoll]] to follow [[Sabine Wren]] at their own pace, they set out in pursuit of her on their own howlers. Hati and her howler tracked Wren across the Peridean grasslands.<ref name="Part Six" /> Hati later rode the howler as she and Skoll led the [[Bandits of Peridea]] to the [[Noti's Pod Mobile House]] caravan, where Wren and [[Ezra Bridger]] resided. After the [[Mission on Peridea]], Hati fled the battle on the howler.<ref name="Part Seven">{{Ahsoka|Part Seven: Dreams and Madness}}</ref> Later, after the conclusion of the [[battle of Peridea]], Hati was mounted on the howler and approached the Bandits' camp, where she horizontally ignited [[Shin Hati's lightsaber|her lightsaber]] at the top of a hill.<ref name="Part Eight">{{Ahsoka|Part Eight: The Jedi, the Witch, and the Warlord}}</ref>

